@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container">
    <div class="privacy-container">

        <div class="privacy-header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p>
                Your privacy matters to us at GameHub.
            </p>
            <small>
                Last Updated: November 16, 2026
            </small>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-highlight">
            <strong>Welcome to GameHub!</strong>
            <p class="mb-0">
                GameHub is a game review blog. You do not need an account to read 
                or write posts, and we do not collect personal information beyond 
                what you choose to submit. This Privacy Policy explains what information 
                appears on the site and how it is used.
            </p>
        </div>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                GameHub is a public website where visitors can read and publish posts about video games. 
                There are no user accounts, logins, or personalized experiences on GameHub.
            </p>
            <p>
                By using our website, you acknowledge that you have read this Privacy Policy.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>
                GameHub only stores the information you enter when you create or edit a post:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Post Information:</strong>
                    The post title, description, and post content.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Game Information:</strong>
                    The game's genre, maker or publisher, 
                    release year and whether it is a multiplayer game.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Author Name:</strong>
                    The name you enter as the author of the post. 
                    This can be your real name or a nickname.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Image:</strong>
                    The image you provide for the post.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>External Links:</strong>
                    Links to a store page (for example, Amazon) and 
                    a rating page (for example, Metacritic).
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Comments and Ratings:</strong>
                    Comments and star ratings you add to posts.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                The information you submit is used only to display 
                your post, comments, and ratings on GameHub. We do 
                not use it for advertising, profiling, or personalization, 
                and we do not sell it.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>4. Public Content</h2>

            <p>
                Everything you submit to GameHub is public. Any 
                visitor can see your posts, author name, image, 
                links, comments, and ratings.
            </p>

            <p>
                Please do not include personal information, 
                such as your full name, address, phone number, 
                or email address, in any field.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>5. Cookies</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub does not use cookies for tracking or 
                advertising. The site may use technical cookies 
                that are required for it to work, such as a security 
                cookie that protects forms against misuse.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>6. Hosting and Technical Information</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub is hosted on Microsoft Azure. Like most web 
                hosting services, Azure may automatically record technical 
                information, such as your IP address, browser type, and the 
                time of your visit, for security and operational purposes. 
                GameHub does not use this information to identify visitors.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>7. External Links</h2>

            <p>
                Posts may contain links to external websites, such as 
                Amazon and Metacritic. These websites are not operated 
                by GameHub and have their own privacy policies. 
                We encourage you to review those policies before using them.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>

            <p>
                GameHub does not knowingly collect personal information from children. 
                Because all submitted content is public, we ask younger visitors not 
                to include any personal information in their posts or comments.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our services are not intended for children
                under the age of 13 unless appropriate
                parental consent and legal safeguards
                are in place.
            </p>

            <p>
                If we discover that personal information
                has been collected from a child in
                violation of applicable law, we will
                take appropriate steps to remove it.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>9. Data Retention and Removal</h2>

            <p>
                Posts, comments, and ratings remain on GameHub until 
                they are edited or deleted. If you want content you submitted 
                to be removed, please contact us.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-section">
            <h2>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy when the website changes. 
                Updates will be published on this page with a revised date.
            </p>
            
            <p>
                Updates will be published on this page
                with a revised date.
            </p>
        </section>
        
        <div class="privacy-footer">
            <p>
                &copy; @DateTime.Now.Year GameHub.
                All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
            <p>
                Thank you for being part of the
                GameHub community.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>